                // data-wpconvert-nav-template placeholder. If the menu group already
                // holds real <a> links besides that single placeholder, the nav is
                // fully rendered — re-injecting menus.json items here would DUPLICATE
                // the entire row (base44/Lovable ZonaVita showed every item twice on
                // WordPress Playground). Only inject when the group has nothing but the
